<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS3" title="In Appendix C Additional evaluations ‣ Evaluating LLMs for Demographic-Targeted Social Bias Detection: A Comprehensive Benchmark Study" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.3 </span>Bias detection of each bias class</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
